sequenceDiagram
    participant Desktop
    participant Phone
    participant Gateway
    Desktop->>Gateway: Create pairing session
    Gateway-->>Desktop: pairing_id + nonce + expiry
    Desktop-->>Phone: QR payload
    Phone->>Gateway: Authenticate + scan pairing_id
    Gateway-->>Phone: Desktop identity
    Gateway-->>Desktop: Phone identity
    Phone->>Gateway: Confirm pairing
    Desktop->>Gateway: Confirm pairing
    Gateway-->>Phone: Short-lived scoped token
    Gateway-->>Desktop: Device link established
